  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The houses that come through that crack are Southern Border’s Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building, Great Space Temple, Bay Pavilion, and Unfixed Manor, and Northern Plains’ Fingerprint Bridge, Demonic Ape Hall, and Minor Sun Building. With these seven Immortal Gu Houses helping, Ba Shi Ba’s pressure falls greatly. Both sides enter a chaotic battle, Immortal Gu Houses rampage and exchange killer moves, and the fight is stuck in a deadlock again. Wu Yong and the rest opened the crack in time and sent the houses out, but they also expended their trump card in advance.",
      "chapters": [
        1731
      ],
